      "content": "1.1 Overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Rajasthan is the largest state of India by area. It is located in the north-western part of India. The name 'Rajasthan' literally means 'Land of Kings' (Raja = King, Sthan = Place). It was formed on 1 November 1956 after the reorganisation of states.",
      "id": "4ixxfrx"
    },
